The code for the ANOVA (run on each Time=24,48,72,96) for each
Treatment (T1,T2) is:
summary(aov(VD_value~Individual))

Previously the data on Time=24 & Treatment=T1 was selected. I know
that this model can't see differences on time or treatment, but, maybe
can be used as zoom at those points (Time and Treatment) concerning
the individual factor (type of Individual would be correct
caption).

I'm not sure that such a Zoom is right or wrong.

